  "openWorldHint": false,
  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Opening Guide"
 },
 "description": "Look up a chess opening by name or slug (for example \"London System\", \"Caro-Kann\" or \"sicilian-defense\") and return Chessigma's guide to it: the main line in SAN, a short summary, up to four key variations with the idea behind each, the strategy for each side, strengths and weaknesses. Full guides exist for 18 popular openings; any of about 3,700 catalogued opening names returns its name, ECO code and moves. When nothing matches, found is false and suggestions lists close names. Links open the opening's trainer and the analysis board on chessigma.com.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
